document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    const hamburgerMenu = document.querySelector('.hamburger-menu');
    const mobileNav = document.querySelector('.mobile-nav');
    const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.mobile-nav a');

    // Toggle menu when hamburger is clicked
    hamburgerMenu.addEventListener('click', function() {
        this.classList.toggle('active');
        mobileNav.classList.toggle('active');

        // Prevent scrolling when menu is open
        document.body.style.overflow = this.classList.contains('active') ? 'hidden' : 'auto';
    });

    // Close menu when a link is clicked
    navLinks.forEach(link => {
        link.addEventListener('click', function() {
            hamburgerMenu.classList.remove('active');
            mobileNav.classList.remove('active');
            document.body.style.overflow = 'auto';
        });
    });
});
```

## Features

1. Smooth animation of hamburger icon transforming into an X
2. Slide-down animation for the navigation menu
3. Staggered fade-in animation for menu items
4. Menu closes when a navigation link is clicked
5. Body scroll is disabled when the menu is open
6. Fully responsive design
7. Hover effects on menu items

This implementation provides a clean, modern hamburger menu that works well on mobile devices. The animations are smooth and provide good visual feedback to users.

